Package: iopolicy
Type: Package
Title: Shared Infrastructure for Industrial-Organization Policy Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Charles", "Taragin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com")
Author: Charles Taragin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Charles Taragin <ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com>
Description: Model-independent infrastructure for designing, testing, and
    stress-testing industrial-organization policy models. The first feature
    is reproducible synthetic market generation; economic demand, conduct,
    calibration, and equilibrium implementations remain in their respective
    economic packages.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/luciu5/iopolicy
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
